Dear UST Team,

Firstly, thanks for your good support as always.

NCM would like to kindly request your assistance to quote on the following 2014 bid for customer Mondelez (attached below).

To help simplify the process, we summarized the bid details as follows:


1)      a.) Summary of Intra Europe Volume (Ranked by Port Pair):

[cid:image002.png@01CEE445.BBD296E0]



b.) Summary of Europe to Middle East / Africa Volume (Ranked by Port Pair):



[cid:image003.png@01CEE445.BBD296E0]



*         More port pairs can be found in the attachment.

*         You may quote on the port pairs that you wish to choose based on your own discretion.  However, if not quoting on a port pair, then please let us know the reason accordingly.

*         The bid is already filtered for Intra Europe to Europe to Middle East/ Africa trades only.


2)      Customer's requirements:



a.       Duration:  1 Year - (Jan 1 - Dec 31, 2014)

b.      Rates should be all-inclusive unless otherwise specified in Columns L (Origin Charges) and Column (Destination Charges).

*         If origin and destination charges need to be applied.  Please specify the total amount and we can try to include it in the ocean freight.

c.       Free-time targets are shown in the bid.  You may counter offer based on your discretion.

d.      Customer has own customized floating bunker formula starting at Zero.  Can change after a quarterly review, based on market oil price fluctuations +/- 10%.

e.      Credit request for 120 days.  However, we will negotiate with customer in future rounds.

f.        Containers must be food-grade.

g.       Please provide other information such as transit time, Lane Capacity (volume that can be supported to the customer), etc.... as requested in the bid.


3)   Requested Due Date:   Oct 10th



*         Please reply within the given due date because we will need time compile and upload all rates.  We apologize for the short notice.

If you have any questions, then please let us know.

Thanks in advance for your assistance.


Regards,
Sheldon Shikhel
Corporate Account Management Team
Hanjin Shipping America, LLC.
Regional Headquarters
Tel: (201) 291-4678
Fax:  (201) 291-9832
