<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#1F497D"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><b><span style="color:#1F497D">2014 Mondelez Bid - Round 2 Offer Request<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>
<p class="MsoListParagraph" style="mso-margin-top-alt:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:.5in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1">
<![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:Symbol;color:#1F497D"><span style="mso-list:Ignore">&middot;<span style="font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><![endif]><b><span style="color:#1F497D">Asia to Asia &amp; Middle East Africa<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:11.0pt;color:#1F497D"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#1F497D">Hello Mr. Tobias Heifler/ UST,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#1F497D"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#1F497D">Firstly, thank you for all your help with Round 1 rates for the Mondelez bid. &nbsp;&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#1F497D"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#1F497D">Here is a brief summary of the Intra-Europe &amp; Europe to Middle East scope we bid on:<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#1F497D"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#1F497D"><img width="602" height="275" id="Picture_x0020_17" src="cid:image005.png@01CEE449.3F0857E0"></span><span style="color:#1F497D"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoListParagraph" style="mso-margin-top-alt:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:.5in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2">
<![if !supportLists]><span style="font-size:8.0pt;font-family:Symbol;color:#1F497D"><span style="mso-list:Ignore">&middot;<span style="font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><![endif]><span style="font-size:8.0pt;color:#1F497D">More detailed port pair rates found in the attachment below.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:11.0pt;color:#1F497D"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#1F497D">Now it is time to review our 2<sup>nd</sup> round offer.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#1F497D"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#1F497D">Mondelez has provided their targets for your reference in
</span><b><u><span style="font-size:14.0pt;color:#E36C0A">Column AA</span></u></b><span style="color:#1F497D">:&nbsp; &#8220;Bid Price Target&#8221;.&nbsp;&nbsp; Their target includes OFT &#43; BAF &#43; CAF.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#1F497D"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#1F497D">If possible, let&#8217;s try to close the gap.&nbsp; I have shown the Rate Gap Difference in the last
</span><b><u><span style="color:#E36C0A">Column BR.<o:p></o:p></span></u></b></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#1F497D"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#1F497D">Please try to adjust the rates where possible in
</span><b><u><span style="color:#E36C0A">Column AP</span></u></b><span style="color:#1F497D">, but keep in mind there will be another round and potentially a face to face meeting.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#1F497D"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#1F497D"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#1F497D">In addition, I will need your help with the following:<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#1F497D"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoListParagraph" style="mso-margin-top-alt:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:.5in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3">
<![if !supportLists]><span style="font-size:14.0pt;font-family:Symbol;color:#00B050"><span style="mso-list:Ignore">&middot;<span style="font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><![endif]><b><span style="font-size:14.0pt;color:#00B050">Double check the free-time days offered.<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>
<p class="MsoListParagraph" style="mso-margin-top-alt:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:1.0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level2 lfo3">
<![if !supportLists]><span style="font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#1F497D"><span style="mso-list:Ignore">o<span style="font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><![endif]><span style="color:#1F497D">I did not receive your input in the first round.&nbsp; Therefore, I had to input a &#8220;safe number&#8221; in order to be able to upload the bid.</span><span style="font-size:11.0pt;color:#1F497D"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoListParagraph" style="mso-margin-top-alt:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:1.0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level2 lfo3">
<![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#1F497D"><span style="mso-list:Ignore">o<span style="font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><![endif]><span style="color:#1F497D">In </span><b><u><span style="font-size:14.0pt;color:#E36C0A">COLUMN BB to COLUMN BD</span></u></b><span style="color:#1F497D">, &#8220;Free Time Offer&#8221;.&nbsp; Please adjust this number matching closer to customer&#8217;s
 target where possible and make note under &#8220;Carrier&#8217;s Comments&#8221; </span><b><u><span style="font-size:14.0pt;color:#E36C0A">Column BE</span></u></b><span style="color:#1F497D"> .<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoListParagraph" style="mso-margin-top-alt:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:.5in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3">
<![if !supportLists]><span style="font-size:14.0pt;font-family:Symbol;color:#00B050"><span style="mso-list:Ignore">&middot;<span style="font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><![endif]><b><span style="font-size:14.0pt;color:#00B050">Origin/ Destination Surcharges<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>
<p class="MsoListParagraph" style="mso-margin-top-alt:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:1.0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level2 lfo3">
<![if !supportLists]><span style="font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#1F497D"><span style="mso-list:Ignore">o<span style="font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><![endif]><span style="color:#1F497D">We will need to itemize surcharges for port pairs that say the following in
</span><b><u><span style="font-size:14.0pt;color:#E36C0A">Column Z</span></u></b><span style="color:#1F497D"> :&nbsp;
<i>&#8220;This lane subject to detailed rate information. Please also download and complete the APAC Supplement.&#8221;
</i></span><i><span style="font-size:11.0pt;color:#1F497D"><o:p></o:p></span></i></p>
<p class="MsoListParagraph" style="mso-margin-top-alt:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:1.0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level2 lfo3">
