</span></span></span><![endif]><span style="color:#1F497D">I am waiting to receive the correct file format.&nbsp; However, in the meantime please record the applicable surcharges and amounts separately.&nbsp;&nbsp; We will need this information later.&nbsp; &nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoListParagraph" style="mso-margin-top-alt:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:.5in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3">
