<p class="MsoListParagraph" style="mso-margin-top-alt:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:1.0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level2 lfo3">
<![if !supportLists]><span style="font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#1F497D"><span style="mso-list:Ignore">o<span style="font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><![endif]><span style="color:#1F497D">I did not receive your input in the first round.&nbsp; Therefore, in
</span><b><u><span style="font-size:14.0pt;color:#E36C0A">COLUMN AT</span></u></b><span style="color:#1F497D"> (&#8220;Lane Capacity (Max Containers / Week)&#8221;) I inputted a &#8220;safe number&#8221; of the Mondelez volume we can support for a given lane.</span><span style="font-size:11.0pt;color:#1F497D"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoListParagraph" style="mso-margin-top-alt:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-left:1.0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level2 lfo3">
