</span><span style="font-family:&quot;&#47569;&#51008;&#44256;&#46357;&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:black">More port pairs can be found in the attachment.</span><span style="font-family:&quot;\B9D1\C740 \ACE0\B515&quot;;color:black">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family:&quot;&#47569;&#51008;&#44256;&#46357;&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:black">
<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-left:1.5in;text-indent:-.25in"><span style="font-family:Symbol;color:black">&middot;</span><span style="font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;\B9D1\C740 \ACE0\B515&quot;;color:black">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span><span style="font-family:&quot;&#47569;&#51008;&#44256;&#46357;&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:black">You may quote on the port pairs that you wish to choose based on your own discretion.</span><span style="font-family:&quot;\B9D1\C740 \ACE0\B515&quot;;color:black">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family:&quot;&#47569;&#51008;&#44256;&#46357;&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:black">
 However, if not quoting on a port pair, then please let us know the reason accordingly.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-left:1.5in;text-indent:-.25in"><span style="font-family:Symbol;color:black">&middot;</span><span style="font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;\B9D1\C740 \ACE0\B515&quot;;color:black">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span><span style="font-family:&quot;&#47569;&#51008;&#44256;&#46357;&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:black">The bid is already filtered for Intra Europe to Europe to Middle East/ Africa trades only.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto"><span style="color:black"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoListParagraph" style="text-indent:-.25in"><b><span style="font-family:&quot;&#47569;&#51008;&#44256;&#46357;&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:black">2)</span></b><b><span style="font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;\B9D1\C740 \ACE0\B515&quot;;color:black">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></b><b><u><span style="font-family:&quot;&#47569;&#51008;&#44256;&#46357;&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:black">Customer<span lang="ZH-CN">&#8217;</span>s requirements:<o:p></o:p></span></u></b></p>
<p class="MsoListParagraph"><span style="font-family:&quot;&#47569;&#51008;&#44256;&#46357;&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:black"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-left:1.0in;text-indent:-.25in"><span style="font-family:&quot;&#47569;&#51008;&#44256;&#46357;&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:black">a.</span><span style="font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;\B9D1\C740 \ACE0\B515&quot;;color:black">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span><span style="font-family:&quot;&#47569;&#51008;&#44256;&#46357;&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:black">Duration:</span><span style="font-family:&quot;\B9D1\C740 \ACE0\B515&quot;;color:black">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family:&quot;&#47569;&#51008;&#44256;&#46357;&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:black"> 1 Year
<span lang="ZH-CN">&#8211;</span> (Jan 1 <span lang="ZH-CN">&#8211;</span> Dec 31, 2014)<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-left:1.0in;text-indent:-.25in"><span style="font-family:&quot;&#47569;&#51008;&#44256;&#46357;&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:black">b.</span><span style="font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;\B9D1\C740 \ACE0\B515&quot;;color:black">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span><span style="font-family:&quot;&#47569;&#51008;&#44256;&#46357;&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:black">Rates should be all-inclusive unless otherwise specified in Columns L (Origin Charges) and Column (Destination Charges).</span><span style="font-family:&quot;\B9D1\C740 \ACE0\B515&quot;;color:black">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family:&quot;&#47569;&#51008;&#44256;&#46357;&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:black">
<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-left:1.5in;text-indent:-.25in"><span style="font-family:Symbol;color:black">&middot;</span><span style="font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;\B9D1\C740 \ACE0\B515&quot;;color:black">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span><span style="font-family:&quot;&#47569;&#51008;&#44256;&#46357;&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:black">If origin and destination charges need to be applied.</span><span style="font-family:&quot;\B9D1\C740 \ACE0\B515&quot;;color:black">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family:&quot;&#47569;&#51008;&#44256;&#46357;&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:black"> Please specify
 the total amount and we can try to include it in the ocean freight.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-left:1.0in;text-indent:-.25in"><span style="font-family:&quot;&#47569;&#51008;&#44256;&#46357;&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:black">c.</span><span style="font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;\B9D1\C740 \ACE0\B515&quot;;color:black">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span><span style="font-family:&quot;&#47569;&#51008;&#44256;&#46357;&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:black">Free-time targets are shown in the bid.</span><span style="font-family:&quot;\B9D1\C740 \ACE0\B515&quot;;color:black">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family:&quot;&#47569;&#51008;&#44256;&#46357;&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:black"> You may counter offer based
 on your discretion.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-left:1.0in;text-indent:-.25in"><span style="font-family:&quot;&#47569;&#51008;&#44256;&#46357;&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:black">d.</span><span style="font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;\B9D1\C740 \ACE0\B515&quot;;color:black">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span><span style="font-family:&quot;&#47569;&#51008;&#44256;&#46357;&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:black">Customer has own customized floating bunker formula starting at Zero.</span><span style="font-family:&quot;\B9D1\C740 \ACE0\B515&quot;;color:black">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family:&quot;&#47569;&#51008;&#44256;&#46357;&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:black">
 Can change after a quarterly review, based on market oil price fluctuations &#43;/- 10%.</span><span style="font-family:&quot;\B9D1\C740 \ACE0\B515&quot;;color:black">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family:&quot;&#47569;&#51008;&#44256;&#46357;&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:black">
<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-left:1.0in;text-indent:-.25in"><span style="font-family:&quot;&#47569;&#51008;&#44256;&#46357;&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:black">e.</span><span style="font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;\B9D1\C740 \ACE0\B515&quot;;color:black">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span><span style="font-family:&quot;&#47569;&#51008;&#44256;&#46357;&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:black">Credit request for 120 days.</span><span style="font-family:&quot;\B9D1\C740 \ACE0\B515&quot;;color:black">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family:&quot;&#47569;&#51008;&#44256;&#46357;&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:black"> However, we will negotiate with customer
 in future rounds.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-left:1.0in;text-indent:-.25in"><span style="font-family:&quot;&#47569;&#51008;&#44256;&#46357;&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:black">f.</span><span style="font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;\B9D1\C740 \ACE0\B515&quot;;color:black">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span><span style="font-family:&quot;&#47569;&#51008;&#44256;&#46357;&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:black">Containers must be food-grade.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-left:1.0in;text-indent:-.25in"><span style="font-family:&quot;&#47569;&#51008;&#44256;&#46357;&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:black">g.</span><span style="font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;\B9D1\C740 \ACE0\B515&quot;;color:black">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span><span style="font-family:&quot;&#47569;&#51008;&#44256;&#46357;&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:black">Please provide other information such as transit time, Lane Capacity (volume that can be supported to the customer), etc<span lang="ZH-CN">&#8230;</span>. as requested in the bid.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto"><span style="color:#1F497D"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoListParagraph" style="text-indent:-.25in"><b><span style="font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;&#47569;&#51008;&#44256;&#46357;&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#E36C0A">3)</span></b><b><span style="font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;\B9D1\C740 \ACE0\B515&quot;;color:#E36C0A">&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></b><b><u><span style="font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;&#47569;&#51008;&#44256;&#46357;&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#E36C0A">Requested Due Date:</span></u></b><b><u><span style="font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;\B9D1\C740 \ACE0\B515&quot;;color:#E36C0A">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></u></b><b><u><span style="font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;&#47569;&#51008;&#44256;&#46357;&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#E36C0A">
 Oct 10<sup>th</sup> <o:p></o:p></span></u></b></p>
<p class="MsoListParagraph"><b><u><span style="font-size:16.0pt;font-family:&quot;&#47569;&#51008;&#44256;&#46357;&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#E36C0A"><o:p><span style="text-decoration:none">&nbsp;</span></o:p></span></u></b></p>
<p class="MsoListParagraph" style="margin-left:1.25in;text-indent:-.25in"><span style="font-family:Symbol;color:black">&middot;</span><span style="font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;\B9D1\C740 \ACE0\B515&quot;;color:black">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span><span style="font-family:&quot;&#47569;&#51008;&#44256;&#46357;&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:black">Please reply within the given due date because we will need time compile and upload all rates.
</span><span style="font-family:&quot;\B9D1\C740 \ACE0\B515&quot;;color:black">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family:&quot;&#47569;&#51008;&#44256;&#46357;&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:black">We apologize for the short notice.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto"><span style="color:black"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto"><span style="color:black">If you have any questions, then please let us know.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto"><span style="color:black"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto"><span style="color:black">Thanks in advance for your assistance.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto">Regards,<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto">Sheldon Shikhel<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto"><span style="font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:navy">Corporate Account Management Team<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto"><span style="font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:navy">Hanjin Shipping America, LLC.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto"><span style="font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:navy">Regional Headquarters<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto"><span style="font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:navy">Tel: (201) 291-4678<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto"><span style="font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:navy">Fax:&nbsp; (201) 291-9832<o:p></o:p></span></p>
